         <photoshop:TextLayers>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>In consideration of this loan, I hereby assigned</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>In consideration of this loan, I hereby assigned</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>interest, service charges and attorney’s fee. I therefore autho</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>interest, service charges and attorney’s fee. I therefore authorized </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>SURETIES’/ CO-MAKERS’ UNDERSTANDING   In consideration of the a</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>SURETIES’/ CO-MAKERS’ UNDERSTANDING   In consideration of the above mentioned loan of the Principal, WE, the undersigned Co-makers, bind ourselves jointly and severally to pay in case principal’s defauly any and all amounts or which may be due hereinafter including interest, service charge and attorney’s fees in accordance with the terms and conditions of the above Promissory Note. In this connection, we hereby assigned in favor of SCSLAI so much of our monies and monetary benefits due or to be due us, individually, from our present offices, Government Service and Insurance System (GSIS), from any fovernment office and any other sources as we sufficient to pay the above loan. Upon default of payment of any installment, all other installments shall become due and payable and we jointly and severally agree to pay additional interest at the rate of ________ per annum of the total amount due until paid, payable when computed monthly. We therefore, authorized the office(s) concerned  to deduct from our salaries, and other allowances like EEA, mid year/year end bonuses, cash gift and anniversary allowance and monies due us, individually, the necessary amounts and to remit said monies to the SCSLAI thru its duly authorized representative(s).We further signified our free and voluntary consent for the collection and processing of our personal sensitive information/data relating to this loan application and other SCSLAI processes. This authority to deduct and deed of assignment shall be irrevocable as long as the above loan or any renewal thereof remains unpaid.  The over payment will be refuned by SCSLAI inless the co-maker has existing deficiency in their loan in which case it will be applied as payment.  </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>WE SIGNED AS CO-MAKERS</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>WE SIGNED AS CO-MAKERS</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>percent (_______)</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>percent (_______)</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>interest and other charges, shall have been fully  paid.  I  he</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>interest and other charges, shall have been fully  paid.  I  hereby  authorized</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>I hereby agreed</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>I hereby agreed</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>need of any formal demand,  and I hereby agreed</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>need of any formal demand,  and I hereby agreed</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>d</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>d</photoshop:LayerText>
